    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/0e92e6cd739235e865cafd0160f83322.poster.avif?t=1751997167\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/0e92e6cd739235e865cafd0160f83322.webm?t=1751997167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/0e92e6cd739235e865cafd0160f83322.mp4?t=1751997167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/93915f44ba53ac9864bcfe37b3ce83cf.avif?t=1751997167\" width=609 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a quest to kill the Undying King of\u00a0Annam, who managed to achieve immortality through sinister means. The King traps millions of souls under his rule, preventing them from death and reincarnation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angered by the King\u2019s act, the Netherworld deities have selected a Revenant of forgotten past to be sent back to the mortal realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the\u00a0King's secret to immortality and decide the fate of the Old Kingdom. Will you obey the Netherworld gods, or choose your own destiny?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/8bd4fd929d879a6ff8348b60bbaea406.poster.avif?t=1751997167\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/8bd4fd929d879a6ff8348b60bbaea406.webm?t=1751997167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/8bd4fd929d879a6ff8348b60bbaea406.mp4?t=1751997167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/acb6f19cc478385444d0cab3b9d29aee.avif?t=1751997167\" width=609 height=100 /></span>Blackblade Revenant is an exhilarating action RPG with multiple playable classes and a unique reincarnation system. Whenever your Revenant dies, you can reincarnate into a different Revenant form and continue the fight, making battles more dynamic and varied than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master each Revenant form that comes with its own set of weapons, skill trees and abilities. Experiment with various weapons ranging from long sword, shield, axe, to spear, dual-wielded and throwing dagger to find the one that suits your combat playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/084801ca1d2a7bdd6941808187a04157.poster.avif?t=1751997167\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/084801ca1d2a7bdd6941808187a04157.webm?t=1751997167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/084801ca1d2a7bdd6941808187a04157.mp4?t=1751997167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/430979afc6e9fea9664bd8b8cc911fd1.avif?t=1751997167\" width=609 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Blackblade Revenant, players will engage in thrilling combat that emphasizes going toe to toe against enemies with chainable parries, skillful dodges and a unique Yin &amp; Yang combo system. Each weapon also features its own unique powerful Weapon Art that can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way to the Imperial Palace by defeating formidable foes who are loyal servants of the King. These boss battles will truly test your skills, precise timing and tactical thinking. If the players succeed in overcoming these devastating encounters, they will be greatly rewarded with new powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/e289018e97cb189105193ca33296d395.poster.avif?t=1751997167\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/e289018e97cb189105193ca33296d395.webm?t=1751997167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/e289018e97cb189105193ca33296d395.mp4?t=1751997167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/5b6165220a3c2f9025822eeb8ddfd5c6.avif?t=1751997167\" width=609 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As agent of the Netherworld, you can enlist the help from the denizens of the realm below, from a melancholy blacksmith to a conniving peddler. Upgrade weapons, train your combat instincts, level up stats, manage your Revenant's abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the old capital of Annam with interconnected areas, hidden paths, unlockable shortcuts and deadly elite enemies. Throughout the journey, you will discover multiple weapons, ancient skill texts,  rare materials and powerful talismans to help your Revenant grow ever more powerful.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging fast-paced combat against fearsome foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable classes, each with different weapons and combat styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Capital city of Annam, filled with mysteries and hidden paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the king's secret to his immortality, and decide the fate of the Old Kingdom</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/0e92e6cd739235e865cafd0160f83322.poster.avif?t=1751997167\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/0e92e6cd739235e865cafd0160f83322.webm?t=1751997167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/0e92e6cd739235e865cafd0160f83322.mp4?t=1751997167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/93915f44ba53ac9864bcfe37b3ce83cf.avif?t=1751997167\" width=609 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a quest to kill the Undying King of\u00a0Annam, who managed to achieve immortality through sinister means. The King traps millions of souls under his rule, preventing them from death and reincarnation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angered by the King\u2019s act, the Netherworld deities have selected a Revenant of forgotten past to be sent back to the mortal realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the\u00a0King's secret to immortality and decide the fate of the Old Kingdom. Will you obey the Netherworld gods, or choose your own destiny?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/8bd4fd929d879a6ff8348b60bbaea406.poster.avif?t=1751997167\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/8bd4fd929d879a6ff8348b60bbaea406.webm?t=1751997167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/8bd4fd929d879a6ff8348b60bbaea406.mp4?t=1751997167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/acb6f19cc478385444d0cab3b9d29aee.avif?t=1751997167\" width=609 height=100 /></span>Blackblade Revenant is an exhilarating action RPG with multiple playable classes and a unique reincarnation system. Whenever your Revenant dies, you can reincarnate into a different Revenant form and continue the fight, making battles more dynamic and varied than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master each Revenant form that comes with its own set of weapons, skill trees and abilities. Experiment with various weapons ranging from long sword, shield, axe, to spear, dual-wielded and throwing dagger to find the one that suits your combat playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/084801ca1d2a7bdd6941808187a04157.poster.avif?t=1751997167\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/084801ca1d2a7bdd6941808187a04157.webm?t=1751997167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/084801ca1d2a7bdd6941808187a04157.mp4?t=1751997167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/430979afc6e9fea9664bd8b8cc911fd1.avif?t=1751997167\" width=609 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Blackblade Revenant, players will engage in thrilling combat that emphasizes going toe to toe against enemies with chainable parries, skillful dodges and a unique Yin &amp; Yang combo system. Each weapon also features its own unique powerful Weapon Art that can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way to the Imperial Palace by defeating formidable foes who are loyal servants of the King. These boss battles will truly test your skills, precise timing and tactical thinking. If the players succeed in overcoming these devastating encounters, they will be greatly rewarded with new powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/e289018e97cb189105193ca33296d395.poster.avif?t=1751997167\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/e289018e97cb189105193ca33296d395.webm?t=1751997167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/e289018e97cb189105193ca33296d395.mp4?t=1751997167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/5b6165220a3c2f9025822eeb8ddfd5c6.avif?t=1751997167\" width=609 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As agent of the Netherworld, you can enlist the help from the denizens of the realm below, from a melancholy blacksmith to a conniving peddler. Upgrade weapons, train your combat instincts, level up stats, manage your Revenant's abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the old capital of Annam with interconnected areas, hidden paths, unlockable shortcuts and deadly elite enemies. Throughout the journey, you will discover multiple weapons, ancient skill texts,  rare materials and powerful talismans to help your Revenant grow ever more powerful.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging fast-paced combat against fearsome foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable classes, each with different weapons and combat styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Capital city of Annam, filled with mysteries and hidden paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the king's secret to his immortality, and decide the fate of the Old Kingdom</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Blackblade Revenant is an action RPG with fast-paced, challenging combat, set during the fall of an ancient kingdom tainted by immortality. Rise from the dead as a chosen Revenant and embark on a quest to defeat the undying King of Annam in this gripping tale of death and rebirth.",
